rement — it’s an operational one. Incidents disrupt production. Permit violations stop operations. But the processes that prevent them are managed as parallel obligations rather than integrated operations."}],["$","p","3",{"className":"text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-6","children":"The operation extracts, processes, and ships. But it does it with more cost per ton, more variability in recovery, and more operational risk than the orebody and the installed equipment should require."}]]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-20 bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-navy-900 mb-6","children":["PROCESSES: ","MINING & METALS"," OPERATIONS"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gold-600 h-1 w-24 mb-12"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl text-navy-900 font-bold mb-3","children":"Mine Planning & Scheduling"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Developing and executing extraction plans that optimize grade, recovery, and equipment utilization against geological constraints. The process where the plan meets the rock."}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl text-navy-900 font-bold mb-3","children":"Drill & Blast Operations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Planning and executing drilling patterns and blast designs to fragment ore efficiently. The process where energy input determines everything downstream."}]]}],"$L2","$L3","$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld"]}]]}]}],"$Le","$Lf","$L10"]}],null,"$L11"]